message: "Please cite this repository if you use the local certificate or its verification code. Preserve the separate attribution of the packing construction."
title: "An exact local-optimality certificate for eleven triangles in a pentagon"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Neal
    given-names: Kevin M.
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-10-30
url: "https://github.com/kevinmneal/eleven-triangle-local-certificate/releases/tag/v0.1.0"
repository-code: "https://github.com/kevinmneal/eleven-triangle-local-certificate"
abstract: "A standard-library Python certificate of strict local optimality for the limiting contact version of the known eleven-equilateral-triangle packing in a regular pentagon. All triangle translations and rotations are independent. This is not a global optimality proof or a new packing construction."
